---
// Routing Architecture: SVG Diagram & Clear Network Topology Concept Explanations
---

<section id="routing" class="routing-section" aria-labelledby="routing-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="routing-header">
      <div class="section-tag">
        <span>03 / NETWORK ROUTING ARCHITECTURE</span>
      </div>
      <h2 id="routing-title" class="section-title">
        线路拓扑与传输概念解析
      </h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        理解 BGP、IPLC、IEPL、中转与直连之间的技术差异。网络性能不仅取决于服务器配置，更取决于数据包跨越国界的物理通道。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive/Graphic SVG Schema with clear disclaimer -->
    <div class="routing-schema-card">
      <div class="schema-header">
        <div class="schema-title-box">
          <h3 class="schema-title">多层网络转发路径拓扑原理</h3>
          <span class="status-badge status-reference">原理示意，不代表实时线路拓扑</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="schema-svg-wrapper">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 900 420" width="100%" height="100%" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="iplc-line-grad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#3C92D4"/>
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#6CDDE9"/>
            </linearGradient>
            <linearGradient id="public-line-grad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#E09F3E"/>
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#E76F51"/>
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>

          <!-- Background container -->
          <rect width="900" height="420" rx="8" fill="#08172B" stroke="#294F69" stroke-width="1"/>

          <!-- Geographic Regions Boundary Panels -->
          <!-- Domestic Zone (China Mainland) -->
          <rect x="30" y="30" width="280" height="360" rx="6" fill="#10263F" opacity="0.6" stroke="#294F69" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>
          <text x="50" y="60" fill="#AFC4DD" font-size="13" font-weight="700" font-family="sans-serif">【境内接入与汇聚区】</text>

          <!-- Border / Physical Transit Zone -->
          <rect x="340" y="30" width="220" height="360" rx="6" fill="#0D2137" opacity="0.4" stroke="#294F69" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>
          <text x="360" y="60" fill="#6CDDE9" font-size="13" font-weight="700" font-family="sans-serif">【跨境传输通道】</text>

          <!-- Overseas Landing Zone -->
          <rect x="590" y="30" width="280" height="360" rx="6" fill="#10263F" opacity="0.6" stroke="#294F69" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>
          <text x="610" y="60" fill="#AFC4DD" font-size="13" font-weight="700" font-family="sans-serif">【境外落地与目标区】</text>

          <!-- Path A: Enterprise IPLC / IEPL Tunnel (Green/Cyan) -->
          <!-- User Terminal -->
          <circle cx="80" cy="120" r="14" fill="#142E49" stroke="#6CDDE9" stroke-width="2"/>
          <text x="80" y="152" fill="#EAF4FF" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">终端用户</text>

          <!-- BGP Ingress Node -->
          <rect x="180" y="95" width="100" height="50" rx="6" fill="#142E49" stroke="#3C92D4" stroke-width="2"/>
          <text x="230" y="118" fill="#6CDDE9" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">三网 BGP 入口</text>
          <text x="230" y="134" fill="#AFC4DD" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">智能就近选路</text>

          <!-- Wire User -> BGP -->
          <path d="M94 120 L 180 120" stroke="#3C92D4" stroke-width="2"/>

          <!-- IPLC Dedicated Wire -->
          <path d="M280 120 L 630 120" stroke="url(#iplc-line-grad)" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="6 3" class="pulse-line"/>
          <!-- Label on wire -->
          <rect x="380" y="105" width="140" height="24" rx="4" fill="#08172B" stroke="#6CDDE9" stroke-width="1"/>
          <text x="450" y="121" fill="#6CDDE9" font-size="10" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">IPLC/IEPL 物理内网专线</text>

          <!-- Overseas Egress Node -->
          <rect x="630" y="95" width="100" height="50" rx="6" fill="#142E49" stroke="#6CDDE9" stroke-width="2"/>
          <text x="680" y="118" fill="#6CDDE9" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">境外落地出口</text>
          <text x="680" y="134" fill="#AFC4DD" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">原生/广播机房 IP</text>

          <!-- Target Site (Google/OpenAI) -->
          <circle cx="810" cy="120" r="16" fill="#142E49" stroke="#3C92D4" stroke-width="2"/>
          <text x="810" y="124" fill="#EAF4FF" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">TARGET</text>
          <text x="810" y="152" fill="#AFC4DD" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">海外目标服务</text>
          <path d="M730 120 L 794 120" stroke="#6CDDE9" stroke-width="2"/>

          <!-- Path B: Public Direct Connect (Orange/Red) -->
          <circle cx="80" cy="270" r="14" fill="#142E49" stroke="#E09F3E" stroke-width="2"/>
          <text x="80" y="302" fill="#EAF4FF" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">普通公网终端</text>

          <!-- Public 163 Network Congestion Node -->
          <rect x="180" y="245" width="100" height="50" rx="6" fill="#142E49" stroke="#E09F3E" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <text x="230" y="268" fill="#E09F3E" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">公网直连出口</text>
          <text x="230" y="284" fill="#AFC4DD" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">163骨干单线</text>

          <path d="M94 270 L 180 270" stroke="#E09F3E" stroke-width="1.5"/>

          <!-- Public International Pipeline with Jitter & Loss -->
          <path d="M280 270 C 350 240, 420 310, 480 260 S 560 290, 630 270" stroke="url(#public-line-grad)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>
          <rect x="375" y="275" width="150" height="24" rx="4" fill="#08172B" stroke="#E09F3E" stroke-width="1"/>
          <text x="450" y="291" fill="#E09F3E" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">公网国际海缆 (晚高峰丢包)</text>

          <rect x="630" y="245" width="100" height="50" rx="6" fill="#142E49" stroke="#E09F3E" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <text x="680" y="268" fill="#E09F3E" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">境外公网接入</text>
          <text x="680" y="284" fill="#AFC4DD" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">容易受限重传</text>

          <circle cx="810" cy="270" r="16" fill="#142E49" stroke="#E09F3E" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <text x="810" y="274" fill="#EAF4FF" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif">TARGET</text>
          <path d="M730 270 L 794 270" stroke="#E09F3E" stroke-width="1.5"/>

          <!-- Top Legend Banner -->
          <rect x="30" y="370" width="840" height="36" rx="4" fill="#050D1A" stroke="#294F69" stroke-width="1"/>
          <text x="50" y="392" fill="#AFC4DD" font-size="11" font-family="sans-serif">
            说明：本图呈现通用中转专线与公网直连的技术差异，不代表 LinkCube 内部实时网络配置。真实出口拓扑需待获取物理凭证。
          </text>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 5 Technology Pillar Cards -->
    <div class="tech-concepts-grid">
      <div class="tech-card">
        <div class="tech-tag font-mono">BGP 边界网关协议</div>
        <h4 class="tech-title">三网智能接入 (BGP)</h4>
        <p class="tech-desc">
          通过与电信、联通、移动三大运营商建立动态路由宣告，客户端请求可自动经由最优路径接入中转入口，有效解决跨运营商互联延迟与跨网抖动。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-card">
        <div class="tech-tag font-mono">IPLC 国际私有租线</div>
        <h4 class="tech-title">点对点内网传输 (IPLC)</h4>
        <p class="tech-desc">
          International Private Leased Circuit。属于物理级二层点对点专线，数据包在两国机房之间经专用内网光纤穿梭，完全脱离公网环境，晚高峰无惧公网骨干网拥塞。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-card">
        <div class="tech-tag font-mono">IEPL 国际以太网专线</div>
        <h4 class="tech-title">以太网封装专线 (IEPL)</h4>
        <p class="tech-desc">
          International Ethernet Private Line。采用标准化以太网接口进行纯净二层透传，相比传统 IPLC 具备更灵活的带宽调度能力，时延更稳定，丢包率极低。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-card">
        <div class="tech-tag font-mono">TRANSIT 中转拓扑</div>
        <h4 class="tech-title">境内汇聚中转</h4>
        <p class="tech-desc">
          用户首先连接境内中转入口服务器，再由中转服务器将流量通过骨干专线压入境外出口。中转入口的位置（如深港、沪日）直接决定了整体链路的初始延迟基线。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-card">
        <div class="tech-tag font-mono">DIRECT 公网直连</div>
        <h4 class="tech-title">普通公网直连</h4>
        <p class="tech-desc">
          客户端直接通过三大运营商的公共国际出口访问境外落地服务器。白天轻载时表现尚可，但在晚高峰极易因国际出口流量争抢引发严重丢包与限速。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .routing-section {
    padding-top: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
    background: #061220;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .routing-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .routing-schema-card {
    background: var(--panel-dark);
    border: 1px solid var(--divider);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .schema-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .schema-title-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .schema-title {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .schema-svg-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 900 / 420;
  }

  .tech-concepts-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .tech-card {
    background: var(--card-dark);
    border: 1px solid var(--divider);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .tech-tag {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .tech-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .tech-desc {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .tech-concepts-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
